<!-- SECTION 8: DOCUMENTS REQUIRED -->
<section class="content-section" id="documents-section">
    <div class="content-container">
        <div class="text-content">
            <h2 class="section-title">MCA Name Guidelines</h2>
            <div class="content-text">
                
                <ul><li><strong>Must include:</strong> 'Private Limited' (private) or 'Limited' (public).</li><li><strong>Must not be identical:</strong> To any existing company or LLP on MCA.</li><li><strong>Must not be similar:</strong> To any registered trademark (search IP India).</li><li><strong>Prohibited words:</strong> 'National', 'Government', 'Reserve Bank', 'Exchange', 'Board' - need specific approval.</li><li><strong>Must reflect activity:</strong> If name suggests specific activity, objects must include it.</li><li><strong>State/region words:</strong> 'Delhi', 'India', 'Bharat' may need additional justification.</li><li><strong>Abbreviations:</strong> Allowed if explained in 'Significance of Name'.</li></ul>

            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

